    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051117.0024\n\nBEIJING, Nov. 17 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nChina reports rising number of entries and exits in 3rd quarter\n\n\n\n\nChina reported rising number of entries and exits in the third quarter of this year, with that of foreign nationals up 16.1 percent year-on-year to 10.63 million.\n\nThe number of entries and exits of Chinese mainland people amounted to 16.51 million in the third quarter, up 7 percent.\n\nAnd entries and exits by Hong Kong and Macao residents rose by 8.9 percent to 49.76 million and the figure of Taiwan residents increased by 9 percent to 2.25 million, according to a briefing made by the Ministry of Public Security Thursday.",
